# Torvus 0g_swamp_hall layer 3, for swb12 (AssignSeekerBoids fn_80_1978): no input is needed.
# The swarm's five kMT_SeekerTarget actors exist from kSM_Create, and the spec supplies one of their
# uids in the gun's own seeker-target vector for one call, so the real caller
# (UpdateSeekerTargets) builds a non-empty keptBoids by itself.  The player only has to stand in the
# area with a camera; god mode keeps the swarm's contact damage out of the way.
@f220 layer 3
@f300 god 1
@f340 tp -157.4 -63.1 39.5
@f360 visor combat
@f400 objs swarm
@f1100 objs swarm
@f1150 items
